"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hey Harper, it\'s good to connect. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been trying to settle all week. My body wont cooperate. I barely slept last night - maybe 5 hours - and even then i kept waking up. My hearts been racing since Monday, for no reason'}]","Ive been trying to settle all week. My body wont cooperate. I barely slept last night - maybe 5 hours - and even then i kept waking up. My hearts been racing since Monday, for no reason",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hey Harper, it\'s good to connect. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been trying to settle all week. My body wont cooperate. I barely slept last night - maybe 5 hours - and even then i kept waking up. My hearts been racing since Monday, for no reason'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, I\'m really concerned hearing about these physical symptoms persisting for days. Heart racing combined with sleep disruption can be really distressing and sometimes signals something needing attention. Have you had a chance to check in with your doctor about this? If not, could we explore some immediate calming techniques while you decide how to proceed?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I dont think the real problem is in my body.... Its because my brain worries constantly that i feel bad. I know my chest feels tight even when nothings happening. But i keep thinkings if im missing some detail, what if i screw something...'}]","I dont think the real problem is in my body.... Its because my brain worries constantly that i feel bad. I know my chest feels tight even when nothings happening. But i keep thinkings if im missing some detail, what if i screw something...",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hey Harper, it\'s good to connect. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been trying to settle all week. My body wont cooperate. I barely slept last night - maybe 5 hours - and even then i kept waking up. My hearts been racing since Monday, for no reason'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, I\'m really concerned hearing about these physical symptoms persisting for days. Heart racing combined with sleep disruption can be really distressing and sometimes signals something needing attention. Have you had a chance to check in with your doctor about this? If not, could we explore some immediate calming techniques while you decide how to proceed?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I dont think the real problem is in my body.... Its because my brain worries constantly that i feel bad. I know my chest feels tight even when nothings happening. But i keep thinkings if im missing some detail, what if i screw something...'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, it makes sense that your mind and body are connected like that - when thoughts race, it\'s completely normal for your body to respond. Would you be open to trying a quick 2-minute grounding exercise today that might help ease both the worrying and that tightness in your chest? It\'s something you could do right now while we\'re talking.'}, {'role': user, 'content': Ok}]",Ok,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hey Harper, it\'s good to connect. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been trying to settle all week. My body wont cooperate. I barely slept last night - maybe 5 hours - and even then i kept waking up. My hearts been racing since Monday, for no reason'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, I\'m really concerned hearing about these physical symptoms persisting for days. Heart racing combined with sleep disruption can be really distressing and sometimes signals something needing attention. Have you had a chance to check in with your doctor about this? If not, could we explore some immediate calming techniques while you decide how to proceed?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I dont think the real problem is in my body.... Its because my brain worries constantly that i feel bad. I know my chest feels tight even when nothings happening. But i keep thinkings if im missing some detail, what if i screw something...'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, it makes sense that your mind and body are connected like that - when thoughts race, it\'s completely normal for your body to respond. Would you be open to trying a quick 2-minute grounding exercise today that might help ease both the worrying and that tightness in your chest? It\'s something you could do right now while we\'re talking.'}, {'role': user, 'content': Ok}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m really glad you\'re open to trying something. Let\'s focus on one simple thing right now: take three slow breaths, inhaling for 4 seconds and exhaling for 6 seconds. As you do this, imagine the tightness in your chest softening with each exhale. How does that feel?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Its good, but i immediatly start overthinking how im breathing... I also tried yoga, but my mind just runs commentary - youre doin it wrong, your form is wrong, bla bla bla'}]","Its good, but i immediatly start overthinking how im breathing... I also tried yoga, but my mind just runs commentary - youre doin it wrong, your form is wrong, bla bla bla",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hey Harper, it\'s good to connect. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been trying to settle all week. My body wont cooperate. I barely slept last night - maybe 5 hours - and even then i kept waking up. My hearts been racing since Monday, for no reason'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, I\'m really concerned hearing about these physical symptoms persisting for days. Heart racing combined with sleep disruption can be really distressing and sometimes signals something needing attention. Have you had a chance to check in with your doctor about this? If not, could we explore some immediate calming techniques while you decide how to proceed?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I dont think the real problem is in my body.... Its because my brain worries constantly that i feel bad. I know my chest feels tight even when nothings happening. But i keep thinkings if im missing some detail, what if i screw something...'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, it makes sense that your mind and body are connected like that - when thoughts race, it\'s completely normal for your body to respond. Would you be open to trying a quick 2-minute grounding exercise today that might help ease both the worrying and that tightness in your chest? It\'s something you could do right now while we\'re talking.'}, {'role': user, 'content': Ok}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m really glad you\'re open to trying something. Let\'s focus on one simple thing right now: take three slow breaths, inhaling for 4 seconds and exhaling for 6 seconds. As you do this, imagine the tightness in your chest softening with each exhale. How does that feel?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Its good, but i immediatly start overthinking how im breathing... I also tried yoga, but my mind just runs commentary - youre doin it wrong, your form is wrong, bla bla bla'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Harper, I\'m hearing how frustrating it is when the mind starts critiquing the practice itself - that\'s such a common trap with anxiety. What if we tried something different: instead of focusing on ""doing it right,"" we just notice the thought ""you\'re doing it wrong"" without fighting it, and let the breathing continue anyway? Would you be open to trying that simple shift?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Yeah, maybe'}]","Yeah, maybe",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
