"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello.}]",Hello.,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Alexander, hello! I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today, and what would you like to explore together?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'m fine, mostly. Just kind of... flat, i guess. Not down, not up. My wife says i\'ve been ""checked out"". Maybe she is right.'}]","I'm fine, mostly. Just kind of... flat, i guess. Not down, not up. My wife says i've been ""checked out"". Maybe she is right.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Alexander, hello! I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today, and what would you like to explore together?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'m fine, mostly. Just kind of... flat, i guess. Not down, not up. My wife says i\'ve been ""checked out"". Maybe she is right.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Alexander, I hear you\'re noticing a flatness in your mood and your wife\'s observation resonates with that. Could you tell me more about what emotions you\'re actually feeling underneath that flatness?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Its like running in autopilot mode. I go to work, come to home, help with the kids. Everythings fine. But there\'s no spark.'}]","Its like running in autopilot mode. I go to work, come to home, help with the kids. Everythings fine. But there's no spark.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Alexander, hello! I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today, and what would you like to explore together?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'m fine, mostly. Just kind of... flat, i guess. Not down, not up. My wife says i\'ve been ""checked out"". Maybe she is right.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Alexander, I hear you\'re noticing a flatness in your mood and your wife\'s observation resonates with that. Could you tell me more about what emotions you\'re actually feeling underneath that flatness?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Its like running in autopilot mode. I go to work, come to home, help with the kids. Everythings fine. But there\'s no spark.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Alexander, I wonder if there are any tiny moments in your routine where you might feel a flicker of something different—like a brief moment of connection with your kids, or maybe a tiny tension before a task? What happens if you pause and notice those small shifts?'}, {'role': user, 'content': I dont feel bad. Just nothing... special.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Alexander, I\'m curious about that ""nothing special"" feeling—what does it feel like when you\'re in that flat space? Could you describe it in a way that helps us understand it better?'}, {'role': user, 'content': I dont know how to say about how i feel.  Im not used to talk about feelings. My family wasnt like that. We handle things. Thats it.}]",I dont know how to say about how i feel.  Im not used to talk about feelings. My family wasnt like that. We handle things. Thats it.,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
