"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia, it\'s good to connect with you today. How have you been feeling since we last talked? I\'m here to listen and support you through whatever you\'d like to share.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'A bit strange, honestly. I\'ve spend a lot of time sending other people to therapy - students, teachers, parents - but ive never been on this side.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really brave of you to acknowledge that shift, Patricia. It takes real courage to step into this space when you\'re used to guiding others. How do you think your experience as someone who\'s always been on the helping side might be making this feel different for you?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive noticed my self... tightening up. I dont feel bad enough to fall apart, but im sharper with people, more impatient.'}]","Ive noticed my self... tightening up. I dont feel bad enough to fall apart, but im sharper with people, more impatient.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia, it\'s good to connect with you today. How have you been feeling since we last talked? I\'m here to listen and support you through whatever you\'d like to share.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'A bit strange, honestly. I\'ve spend a lot of time sending other people to therapy - students, teachers, parents - but ive never been on this side.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really brave of you to acknowledge that shift, Patricia. It takes real courage to step into this space when you\'re used to guiding others. How do you think your experience as someone who\'s always been on the helping side might be making this feel different for you?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive noticed my self... tightening up. I dont feel bad enough to fall apart, but im sharper with people, more impatient.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That tightening feeling you\'re describing—like your emotions are becoming more compressed—can definitely show up as sharper edges with others. I\'m curious, what do you notice about what\'s happening in your mind when you feel this way? What might be adding to that sense of constriction lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Waking up every night around 3 am doesnt help. Once im awake, my mind just starts running... meetings, tasks, things i said. '}]","Waking up every night around 3 am doesnt help. Once im awake, my mind just starts running... meetings, tasks, things i said. ",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia, it\'s good to connect with you today. How have you been feeling since we last talked? I\'m here to listen and support you through whatever you\'d like to share.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'A bit strange, honestly. I\'ve spend a lot of time sending other people to therapy - students, teachers, parents - but ive never been on this side.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really brave of you to acknowledge that shift, Patricia. It takes real courage to step into this space when you\'re used to guiding others. How do you think your experience as someone who\'s always been on the helping side might be making this feel different for you?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive noticed my self... tightening up. I dont feel bad enough to fall apart, but im sharper with people, more impatient.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That tightening feeling you\'re describing—like your emotions are becoming more compressed—can definitely show up as sharper edges with others. I\'m curious, what do you notice about what\'s happening in your mind when you feel this way? What might be adding to that sense of constriction lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Waking up every night around 3 am doesnt help. Once im awake, my mind just starts running... meetings, tasks, things i said. '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That 3am wakefulness sounds incredibly draining, Patricia. When your mind starts racing with work thoughts like that, it can really feed into that feeling of emotional tightening you described earlier. I\'m curious - what\'s going through your mind during those hours? Do you find yourself trying to solve those problems, or is it more like your mind just won\'t switch off?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Both. i try to solve some things and i cant stop my mind. I used to shake it off, but lately it doesnt work like it used to...'}]","Both. i try to solve some things and i cant stop my mind. I used to shake it off, but lately it doesnt work like it used to...",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia, it\'s good to connect with you today. How have you been feeling since we last talked? I\'m here to listen and support you through whatever you\'d like to share.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'A bit strange, honestly. I\'ve spend a lot of time sending other people to therapy - students, teachers, parents - but ive never been on this side.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really brave of you to acknowledge that shift, Patricia. It takes real courage to step into this space when you\'re used to guiding others. How do you think your experience as someone who\'s always been on the helping side might be making this feel different for you?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive noticed my self... tightening up. I dont feel bad enough to fall apart, but im sharper with people, more impatient.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That tightening feeling you\'re describing—like your emotions are becoming more compressed—can definitely show up as sharper edges with others. I\'m curious, what do you notice about what\'s happening in your mind when you feel this way? What might be adding to that sense of constriction lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Waking up every night around 3 am doesnt help. Once im awake, my mind just starts running... meetings, tasks, things i said. '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That 3am wakefulness sounds incredibly draining, Patricia. When your mind starts racing with work thoughts like that, it can really feed into that feeling of emotional tightening you described earlier. I\'m curious - what\'s going through your mind during those hours? Do you find yourself trying to solve those problems, or is it more like your mind just won\'t switch off?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Both. i try to solve some things and i cant stop my mind. I used to shake it off, but lately it doesnt work like it used to...'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'It makes sense that when your mind\'s been working overtime, those mental muscles get tired too, Patricia. I\'m wondering if it\'s the thoughts themselves that feel heavier now, or if it\'s more about how much energy you have left to work with them. Would it help to explore what\'s changed in your mental resources lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think is more about how much energy i have left.  Everything still gets done, but it feels heavier. I think this is also starting to show... my husbadn mentioned that i seem flat.'}]","I think is more about how much energy i have left.  Everything still gets done, but it feels heavier. I think this is also starting to show... my husbadn mentioned that i seem flat.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia, it\'s good to connect with you today. How have you been feeling since we last talked? I\'m here to listen and support you through whatever you\'d like to share.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'A bit strange, honestly. I\'ve spend a lot of time sending other people to therapy - students, teachers, parents - but ive never been on this side.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really brave of you to acknowledge that shift, Patricia. It takes real courage to step into this space when you\'re used to guiding others. How do you think your experience as someone who\'s always been on the helping side might be making this feel different for you?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive noticed my self... tightening up. I dont feel bad enough to fall apart, but im sharper with people, more impatient.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That tightening feeling you\'re describing—like your emotions are becoming more compressed—can definitely show up as sharper edges with others. I\'m curious, what do you notice about what\'s happening in your mind when you feel this way? What might be adding to that sense of constriction lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Waking up every night around 3 am doesnt help. Once im awake, my mind just starts running... meetings, tasks, things i said. '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That 3am wakefulness sounds incredibly draining, Patricia. When your mind starts racing with work thoughts like that, it can really feed into that feeling of emotional tightening you described earlier. I\'m curious - what\'s going through your mind during those hours? Do you find yourself trying to solve those problems, or is it more like your mind just won\'t switch off?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Both. i try to solve some things and i cant stop my mind. I used to shake it off, but lately it doesnt work like it used to...'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'It makes sense that when your mind\'s been working overtime, those mental muscles get tired too, Patricia. I\'m wondering if it\'s the thoughts themselves that feel heavier now, or if it\'s more about how much energy you have left to work with them. Would it help to explore what\'s changed in your mental resources lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think is more about how much energy i have left.  Everything still gets done, but it feels heavier. I think this is also starting to show... my husbadn mentioned that i seem flat.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That emotional flattening can make it harder to feel fully connected, Patricia. I\'m curious—what does it feel like to be less emotionally engaged, especially with the people you care about? How does that shift affect your sense of being present in those moments?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I dont want this to creep into my work. I think im good managing others emotions, but not my own. I think im overreacting and getting irritated by small things - like a late report or traffic.'}]","I dont want this to creep into my work. I think im good managing others emotions, but not my own. I think im overreacting and getting irritated by small things - like a late report or traffic.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
