 mind\'s been working overtime, those mental muscles get tired too, Patricia. I\'m wondering if it\'s the thoughts themselves that feel heavier now, or if it\'s more about how much energy you have left to work with them. Would it help to explore what\'s changed in your mental resources lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think is more about how much energy i have left.  Everything still gets done, but it feels heavier. I think this is also starting to show... my husbadn mentioned that i seem flat.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That emotional flattening can make it harder to feel fully connected, Patricia. I\'m curious—what does it feel like to be less emotionally engaged, especially with the people you care about? How does that shift affect your sense of being present in those moments?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I dont want this to creep into my work. I think im good managing others emotions, but not my own. I think im overreacting and getting irritated by small things - like a late report or traffic.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such an important observation about your work environment potentially amplifying those small irritations, Patricia. I\'m curious - do you notice this pattern more when you\'re already feeling low on energy from those 3am wakefulness? It might help us see how these pieces fit together.'}, {'role': user, 'content': Yes. The lack of sleep doesnt help.}]",Yes. The lack of sleep doesnt help.,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
