curious—do you notice this happening more when you\'re running on empty, or is it something you\'re becoming more aware of now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': I think this got worse in the last year. But maybe i started noticing it a couple of years ago.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s insightful - noticing something shifts over time shows real self-awareness, Patricia. I\'m curious what was happening in your life around the time you first started noticing these changes, especially as a leader who\'s always been on the helping side.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'During COVID i was in constant crisis management mode. I think i never really came down from it. I just kept going. '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such an important insight, Patricia. When we\'ve been in survival mode for so long, it makes sense that coming out of it feels unfamiliar - like your nervous system is still waiting for the next alarm. I\'m curious what that ""never coming down"" feels like in your body now, especially as you try to shift into rest mode?'}, {'role': user, 'content': Its like im still braced for the next emergency.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That makes perfect sense - your body\'s been practicing emergency readiness for so long that it\'s now your default setting, Patricia. It\'s actually a sign of how capable you are at protecting yourself, even if it\'s making it hard to rest now. How does it feel to recognize that this tension is your body\'s way of trying to keep you safe?'}, {'role': user, 'content': I suppose is good to know... do you think is a way of taking care of myself?}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such a thoughtful way to look at it - your body is absolutely trying to care for you by keeping you alert, Patricia. It\'s impressive how your nervous system has been working so hard to protect you. I\'m curious - while this readiness has been helpful, is there any part of you that\'s wondering if it might be time to shift into a different kind of care now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': yes. I dont want this state of alertness.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That takes real courage to name what you\'re ready to change, Patricia. I\'m curious - what\'s one small way you might use your natural leadership skills to gently guide yourself toward a different kind of alertness, maybe one that still keeps you capable but feels more sustainable?'}, {'role': user, 'content': Maybe trying to reconnect with my husband.}]",Maybe trying to reconnect with my husband.,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}]",Hi,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia. I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today? What\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right'}]","Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia. I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today? What\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it sounds like you\'re noticing a shift in your emotional availability and patience. I\'m wondering what\'s been coming up for you lately that might be contributing to this feeling?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive always pried myself of being steady, but lately... im just... less steady. its not that i break down, but i dont enjoy things.'}]","Ive always pried myself of being steady, but lately... im just... less steady. its not that i break down, but i dont enjoy things.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia. I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today? What\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it sounds like you\'re noticing a shift in your emotional availability and patience. I\'m wondering what\'s been coming up for you lately that might be contributing to this feeling?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive always pried myself of being steady, but lately... im just... less steady. its not that i break down, but i dont enjoy things.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it takes real awareness to notice these shifts in yourself. I wonder if anything has been changing in your daily life that might be pulling you away from the steadiness you usually rely on?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think the pandemic accelerated this. I got into survival mode, tooking care of everyone else and then... it seems like i never got out of it. Instead of really living, my life is neverending task list'}]","I think the pandemic accelerated this. I got into survival mode, tooking care of everyone else and then... it seems like i never got out of it. Instead of really living, my life is neverending task list",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia. I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today? What\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it sounds like you\'re noticing a shift in your emotional availability and patience. I\'m wondering what\'s been coming up for you lately that might be contributing to this feeling?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive always pried myself of being steady, but lately... im just... less steady. its not that i break down, but i dont enjoy things.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it takes real awareness to notice these shifts in yourself. I wonder if anything has been changing in your daily life that might be pulling you away from the steadiness you usually rely on?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think the pandemic accelerated this. I got into survival mode, tooking care of everyone else and then... it seems like i never got out of it. Instead of really living, my life is neverending task list'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it makes complete sense that pandemic survival mode would leave such lasting traces in your daily rhythm. I wonder what parts of that ""never ending task list"" life might be keeping you in that heightened state even now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything. My life is management. And im good at it, but its all practical. I dont feel spontaneous. Or connected.'}]","Everything. My life is management. And im good at it, but its all practical. I dont feel spontaneous. Or connected.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia. I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today? What\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it sounds like you\'re noticing a shift in your emotional availability and patience. I\'m wondering what\'s been coming up for you lately that might be contributing to this feeling?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive always pried myself of being steady, but lately... im just... less steady. its not that i break down, but i dont enjoy things.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it takes real awareness to notice these shifts in yourself. I wonder if anything has been changing in your daily life that might be pulling you away from the steadiness you usually rely on?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think the pandemic accelerated this. I got into survival mode, tooking care of everyone else and then... it seems like i never got out of it. Instead of really living, my life is neverending task list'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it makes complete sense that pandemic survival mode would leave such lasting traces in your daily rhythm. I wonder what parts of that ""never ending task list"" life might be keeping you in that heightened state even now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything. My life is management. And im good at it, but its all practical. I dont feel spontaneous. Or connected.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, I wonder if you\'ve noticed any moments lately where you felt a flicker of joy or connection despite the management tasks? Sometimes these small moments can point to ways to weave more meaning back into your day.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Sometimes... But ive built my life around being competent. And now, its starting to feel a bit empty. its not dramatic! but... muted!'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, that ""muted"" feeling you\'re describing is such a precise way to capture that subtle shift beneath the competence. I wonder if you\'ve noticed what might be getting quieter in your inner life as you navigate all those management tasks?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'For one side, things are quieter, flat. But, for another... they are intensifying. The traffic, schedulling mishaps... every little thing get under my skin faster than it should'}]","For one side, things are quieter, flat. But, for another... they are intensifying. The traffic, schedulling mishaps... every little thing get under my skin faster than it should",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia. I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today? What\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it sounds like you\'re noticing a shift in your emotional availability and patience. I\'m wondering what\'s been coming up for you lately that might be contributing to this feeling?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive always pried myself of being steady, but lately... im just... less steady. its not that i break down, but i dont enjoy things.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it takes real awareness to notice these shifts in yourself. I wonder if anything has been changing in your daily life that might be pulling you away from the steadiness you usually rely on?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think the pandemic accelerated this. I got into survival mode, tooking care of everyone else and then... it seems like i never got out of it. Instead of really living, my life is neverending task list'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it makes complete sense that pandemic survival mode would leave such lasting traces in your daily rhythm. I wonder what parts of that ""never ending task list"" life might be keeping you in that heightened state even now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything. My life is management. And im good at it, but its all practical. I dont feel spontaneous. Or connected.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, I wonder if you\'ve noticed any moments lately where you felt a flicker of joy or connection despite the management tasks? Sometimes these small moments can point to ways to weave more meaning back into your day.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Sometimes... But ive built my life around being competent. And now, its starting to feel a bit empty. its not dramatic! but... muted!'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, that ""muted"" feeling you\'re describing is such a precise way to capture that subtle shift beneath the competence. I wonder if you\'ve noticed what might be getting quieter in your inner life as you navigate all those management tasks?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'For one side, things are quieter, flat. But, for another... they are intensifying. The traffic, schedulling mishaps... every little thing get under my skin faster than it should'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it\'s interesting how these two experiences - the muted feelings and the heightened reactions - might actually be connected. When we\'re constantly on high alert, it can make us miss the subtle joys while amplifying small frustrations. I wonder if you\'ve noticed when these heightened reactions happen most often?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think when im frustrated. '}]",I think when im frustrated. ,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hi}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Patricia. I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today? What\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive been feeling... off. Nothing catastrophic, but my patience is thinner, my mood flatter. My husband said im harder to reach lately, and i think he is right'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it sounds like you\'re noticing a shift in your emotional availability and patience. I\'m wondering what\'s been coming up for you lately that might be contributing to this feeling?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ive always pried myself of being steady, but lately... im just... less steady. its not that i break down, but i dont enjoy things.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it takes real awareness to notice these shifts in yourself. I wonder if anything has been changing in your daily life that might be pulling you away from the steadiness you usually rely on?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think the pandemic accelerated this. I got into survival mode, tooking care of everyone else and then... it seems like i never got out of it. Instead of really living, my life is neverending task list'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, it makes complete sense that pandemic survival mode would leave such lasting traces in your daily rhythm. I wonder what parts of that ""never ending task list"" life might be keeping you in that heightened state even now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything. My life is management. And im good at it, but its all practical. I dont feel spontaneous. Or connected.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Patricia, I wonder if you\'ve noticed any moments lately where you felt a flicker of joy or connection despite the management tasks? Sometimes these small moments can point to ways to weave more meaning back into your day.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Sometimes... But ive built my life around being competent. And now, its starting to feel a bit empty. i