 user, 'content': 'I\'ve never thought about that. Thank you. I keep reminding myself that I don’t need to earn kindness — from others or from myself'}]",I've never thought about that. Thank you. I keep reminding myself that I don’t need to earn kindness — from others or from myself,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
