"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello there}]",Hello there,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello there}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Brandon, thanks for reaching out. I\'m glad you\'re here. What\'s been on your mind lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': feeling kinda tired this week}]",feeling kinda tired this week,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello there}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Brandon, thanks for reaching out. I\'m glad you\'re here. What\'s been on your mind lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': feeling kinda tired this week}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear that tiredness can really weigh on you. Have you noticed if it\'s tied to any particular thoughts or routines this week?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'ve been thinking about wanting to be the one people can rely on'}]",I've been thinking about wanting to be the one people can rely on,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello there}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Brandon, thanks for reaching out. I\'m glad you\'re here. What\'s been on your mind lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': feeling kinda tired this week}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear that tiredness can really weigh on you. Have you noticed if it\'s tied to any particular thoughts or routines this week?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'ve been thinking about wanting to be the one people can rely on'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really meaningful - wanting to be someone others can count on shows how much you care about your relationships. I wonder if there\'s a part of you that feels tired because you\'re holding that responsibility so carefully? When you\'re thinking about being reliable, what do you need to feel supported too?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'It\'s not that I need to feel supported, but when I do something, I do it right. So I guess people want that from me'}]","It's not that I need to feel supported, but when I do something, I do it right. So I guess people want that from me",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello there}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Brandon, thanks for reaching out. I\'m glad you\'re here. What\'s been on your mind lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': feeling kinda tired this week}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear that tiredness can really weigh on you. Have you noticed if it\'s tied to any particular thoughts or routines this week?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'ve been thinking about wanting to be the one people can rely on'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really meaningful - wanting to be someone others can count on shows how much you care about your relationships. I wonder if there\'s a part of you that feels tired because you\'re holding that responsibility so carefully? When you\'re thinking about being reliable, what do you need to feel supported too?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'It\'s not that I need to feel supported, but when I do something, I do it right. So I guess people want that from me'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how important it is for you to do things right - that shows real dedication. But I wonder if there\'s a part of you that feels like your worth depends on being perfect? Because when we\'re all human, the people who truly support each other are the ones who understand that ""right"" sometimes means ""good enough.""'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Good enough? If you’re not sure, I double-check — that’s my rule'}]","Good enough? If you’re not sure, I double-check — that’s my rule",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello there}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Brandon, thanks for reaching out. I\'m glad you\'re here. What\'s been on your mind lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': feeling kinda tired this week}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear that tiredness can really weigh on you. Have you noticed if it\'s tied to any particular thoughts or routines this week?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'ve been thinking about wanting to be the one people can rely on'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really meaningful - wanting to be someone others can count on shows how much you care about your relationships. I wonder if there\'s a part of you that feels tired because you\'re holding that responsibility so carefully? When you\'re thinking about being reliable, what do you need to feel supported too?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'It\'s not that I need to feel supported, but when I do something, I do it right. So I guess people want that from me'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how important it is for you to do things right - that shows real dedication. But I wonder if there\'s a part of you that feels like your worth depends on being perfect? Because when we\'re all human, the people who truly support each other are the ones who understand that ""right"" sometimes means ""good enough.""'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Good enough? If you’re not sure, I double-check — that’s my rule'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I see how your double-checking rule comes from wanting to be reliable, but I wonder if it ever creates space between you and the people you care about? When you\'re so focused on getting everything ""right,"" does it ever feel like you\'re holding back parts of yourself?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t think that. I just say what I mean, no ""maybe\'s""'}]","I don't think that. I just say what I mean, no ""maybe's""",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello there}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Brandon, thanks for reaching out. I\'m glad you\'re here. What\'s been on your mind lately?'}, {'role': user, 'content': feeling kinda tired this week}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear that tiredness can really weigh on you. Have you noticed if it\'s tied to any particular thoughts or routines this week?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'ve been thinking about wanting to be the one people can rely on'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s really meaningful - wanting to be someone others can count on shows how much you care about your relationships. I wonder if there\'s a part of you that feels tired because you\'re holding that responsibility so carefully? When you\'re thinking about being reliable, what do you need to feel supported too?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'It\'s not that I need to feel supported, but when I do something, I do it right. So I guess people want that from me'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how important it is for you to do things right - that shows real dedication. But I wonder if there\'s a part of you that feels like your worth depends on being perfect? Because when we\'re all human, the people who truly support each other are the ones who understand that ""right"" sometimes means ""good enough.""'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Good enough? If you’re not sure, I double-check — that’s my rule'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I see how your double-checking rule comes from wanting to be reliable, but I wonder if it ever creates space between you and the people you care about? When you\'re so focused on getting everything ""right,"" does it ever feel like you\'re holding back parts of yourself?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t think that. I just say what I mean, no ""maybe\'s""'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That clarity is a real gift to share with others - it builds trust. I\'m curious though: when you\'re absolutely certain about how you feel, does that ever make it harder to explore the ""maybe\'s"" that often lead to deeper understanding?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I speak my mind! I know I can be blunt, but at least I’m honest'}]","I speak my mind! I know I can be blunt, but at least I’m honest",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
