r experience as principal actually prepare you for this new chapter?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Well it has been more than twenty years since I sat in a classroom. I feel I like the logistics of having to prepara daily classes scares me, and nothing used to scare me! I know I have skills and I know the kids respect me, that\'s a plus, what do you think?'}]","Well it has been more than twenty years since I sat in a classroom. I feel I like the logistics of having to prepara daily classes scares me, and nothing used to scare me! I know I have skills and I know the kids respect me, that's a plus, what do you think?",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': 'Hello Phoenix, what\'s on your mind?'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hello Michelle, I\'m here to listen to what\'s on your mind. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I fell low... '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Michelle, I\'m really sorry you\'re feeling this way. Would you like to tell me more about what\'s on your mind right now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Yes, I can tell you that it has been a while since I\'ve been feeling like that is like the things that i used to enjoy dont give me any pleasure anymore... and I have this feeling that this route is a dead end.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Michelle, it sounds like you\'re carrying a heavy weight right now, especially with that feeling of things having no direction. When you say ""this route is a dead end,"" what specifically feels stuck to you? I\'d like to understand what\'s making it feel that way so we can find other paths forward together.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'It\'s the small routines things in day to day. I know I shouldn\'t feel this way after everything I achieved, but all the achievements seem vain now.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Michelle, it makes sense that when daily routines and achievements start feeling meaningless, it creates a real struggle for someone who\'s always been driven by purpose. I\'m curious - when you think about what used to give your life meaning, what\'s shifted? And how might this connect to those early morning awakenings you mentioned?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Well I stepped down from being a principal at school. And being back in a classroom feels very scary to me... I don\'t think I will manage it'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Michelle, stepping into a classroom role after being a principal is a significant shift, and it\'s completely understandable to feel uncertain about it. I\'m curious - what specifically feels most intimidating about being back in the classroom? And how might your experience as principal actually prepare you for this new chapter?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Well it has been more than twenty years since I sat in a classroom. I feel I like the logistics of having to prepara daily classes scares me, and nothing used to scare me! I know I have skills and I know the kids respect me, that\'s a plus, what do you think?'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Michelle, it\'s interesting that you\'re noticing this shift in what feels challenging now. Could you think of a time when you *did* feel scared or uncertain about something, even if it was a long time ago? Sometimes recognizing those past moments of courage can help us see how much you\'ve already grown through challenges.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I was always so driven throughout my life, and full of energy, that this is the first time I feel like this. I can\'t think of any other time like this'}]","I was always so driven throughout my life, and full of energy, that this is the first time I feel like this. I can't think of any other time like this",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
