r experience as principal actually prepare you for this new chapter?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Well it has been more than twenty years since I sat in a classroom. I feel I like the logistics of having to prepara daily classes scares me, and nothing used to scare me! I know I have skills and I know the kids respect me, that\'s a plus, what do you think?'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Michelle, it\'s interesting that you\'re noticing this shift in what feels challenging now. Could you think of a time when you *did* feel scared or uncertain about something, even if it was a long time ago? Sometimes recognizing those past moments of courage can help us see how much you\'ve already grown through challenges.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I was always so driven throughout my life, and full of energy, that this is the first time I feel like this. I can\'t think of any other time like this'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Michelle, it’s heartbreaking to witness such a deep shift in someone who’s always been so full of purpose. I’m curious—what’s one thing that still feels familiar or true about you, even now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I know I put a lot of effort in everything I do. I know I am a good wife, a good listener, but the small things I used to enjoy they feel empty now.  It\'s like if I lost a part of me, they joyful part'}]","I know I put a lot of effort in everything I do. I know I am a good wife, a good listener, but the small things I used to enjoy they feel empty now.  It's like if I lost a part of me, they joyful part",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
