ly shaping your life.'}, {'role': user, 'content': But i´m not happy must of the time!...What if this sadness never really goes away? I´m so tired!}]",But i´m not happy must of the time!...What if this sadness never really goes away? I´m so tired!,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
