 sometimes make the background worry feel louder because there\'s less distraction. I\'m curious: what happens in your mind when you try to slow down? Sometimes noticing what thoughts pop up during those slower moments helps us understand why it feels threatening.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Why do I get irritated so easily now, even with the people I love most?'}]","Why do I get irritated so easily now, even with the people I love most?",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
