 user, 'content': Keep it positive. Though with my irritable self and jittery coffee body idk how that will go}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'When you say ""keep it positive"" at the booth, what\'s one small thing you\'d notice if you\'re really embodying that?'}, {'role': user, 'content': Be encouraging when they make sales. Or talk up their art to customers}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such a kind intention to stay present with your partner\'s success. I\'m curious—when you\'re choosing to encourage them, does it ever feel like you\'re also creating space for yourself to breathe through the day?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Hmm I haven\'t paid attention to that before'}]",Hmm I haven't paid attention to that before,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
