 they are easy to lose sight of'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such a real and relatable experience. What if we thought about how you could gently remind yourself of those moments when tension starts to build, so you don\'t lose sight of the connection you already share?'}, {'role': user, 'content': That makes sense. Like jotting it down on a piece of paper?}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s a great start. What if we tried something even simpler, like noticing one small thing that made you smile during the day and sharing it with your kids right then?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Ok, like I could say to my wife at dinner -- the chicken is delicious'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such a thoughtful way to start. How do you imagine the room would feel if you shared something like that with both your wife and kids?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'She\'d be surprised. I don\'t say things like that often'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That makes it even more meaningful, Eric. It’s not about saying something big—it’s about noticing and sharing those small moments that matter to you. What if you tried this once this week, just to see how it feels?'}, {'role': user, 'content': ok i can}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I love that you\'re willing to give it a try, Eric. What if we check in next week about how that moment felt—just one small piece of the bigger picture you\'re building?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'ll try that. How will I remember?'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such a practical question, Eric. What if you tied it to something you already do, like setting a gentle reminder on your phone for your morning coffee break?'}, {'role': user, 'content': ok good idea}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I love that you\'re open to trying this. Would you be willing to jot down one sentence after you share something positive, just to remind yourself how those moments feel?'}, {'role': user, 'content': yeah}, {'role': assis