{'role': assistant, 'content': 'Jessica, I love how you\'re willing to shift your focus from ""fixing"" sleep to noticing what your mind is trying to tell you. What if we thought of those quiet hours not as interruptions, but as your mind\'s way of whispering important messages - messages that might actually help you reconnect with what matters most to you?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I can get that in an abstract sense, but my mind is whispering to me at 3 am that I am unhappy at work, that I need a sense of purpose and that I don\'t feel like I have one right now'}]","I can get that in an abstract sense, but my mind is whispering to me at 3 am that I am unhappy at work, that I need a sense of purpose and that I don't feel like I have one right now",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
