'That\'s a thoughtful approach, Kenneth. When you imagine mentoring, what would help you feel more connected to the present moment rather than the past?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Perhaps exercising curiosity about what they are struggling with, or interested in learning'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s a beautiful shift in perspective, Kenneth. When you focus on what they\'re currently learning or struggling with, it naturally creates space for you to share your own present-day experiences. How might that curiosity help you feel more present in these conversations rather than anchored in the past?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'When I was working, everything was measurable. Purpose now feels abstract, which I find uncomfortable, but it also encourages me to be in the moment'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s a really insightful connection, Kenneth. When you notice this abstract purpose pulling you toward the present, what\'s one small moment today where you felt that pull most strongly?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'There’s this urge to keep solving problems, but the problems I face now aren’t legal,  they’re emotional, and that’s harder'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s an important realization, Kenneth. When you notice this urge to ""solve"" emotional challenges, what happens when you try applying that same problem-solving approach to something that\'s more about feeling than fixing?'}, {'role': user, 'content': It’s difficult to accept that I can’t influence outcomes the way I used to}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s such a natural feeling to have, Kenneth. When you notice that urge to influence outcomes, what if you tried to channel that same energy into noticing how you\'re adapting to these new emotional challenges instead?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t think I\'m doing a very good job at adapting'}]",I don't think I'm doing a very good job at adapting,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
