"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}]","Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}]","Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don't like to talk to anyone",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you say nothing interests you anymore, I wonder what that emotional and physical space feels like for you—like a quiet room with no light, or something else? I\'m here to listen with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that'}]","Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you say nothing interests you anymore, I wonder what that emotional and physical space feels like for you—like a quiet room with no light, or something else? I\'m here to listen with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how exhausting it feels to say you\'re tired when you\'re avoiding something important. What are you finding it harder to face these days, Kenneth?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything from brushing my teeth, to walking the dog, taking out the trash, eating'}]","Everything from brushing my teeth, to walking the dog, taking out the trash, eating",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you say nothing interests you anymore, I wonder what that emotional and physical space feels like for you—like a quiet room with no light, or something else? I\'m here to listen with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how exhausting it feels to say you\'re tired when you\'re avoiding something important. What are you finding it harder to face these days, Kenneth?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything from brushing my teeth, to walking the dog, taking out the trash, eating'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when even caring for your dog or making sure you eat feels like moving through heavy water, what does that heaviness tell you about what you\'re carrying right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My mind wanders to everything I could\'ve done differently'}]",My mind wanders to everything I could've done differently,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you say nothing interests you anymore, I wonder what that emotional and physical space feels like for you—like a quiet room with no light, or something else? I\'m here to listen with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how exhausting it feels to say you\'re tired when you\'re avoiding something important. What are you finding it harder to face these days, Kenneth?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything from brushing my teeth, to walking the dog, taking out the trash, eating'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when even caring for your dog or making sure you eat feels like moving through heavy water, what does that heaviness tell you about what you\'re carrying right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My mind wanders to everything I could\'ve done differently'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, it makes sense that these thoughts would feel so heavy when you\'re already carrying so much. When you notice your mind going to ""what could\'ve been,"" what\'s one thing that keeps coming up for you right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I used to live by principles like fairness and accountability but lately I\'m not sure how those fit into my day anymore'}]",I used to live by principles like fairness and accountability but lately I'm not sure how those fit into my day anymore,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you say nothing interests you anymore, I wonder what that emotional and physical space feels like for you—like a quiet room with no light, or something else? I\'m here to listen with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how exhausting it feels to say you\'re tired when you\'re avoiding something important. What are you finding it harder to face these days, Kenneth?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything from brushing my teeth, to walking the dog, taking out the trash, eating'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when even caring for your dog or making sure you eat feels like moving through heavy water, what does that heaviness tell you about what you\'re carrying right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My mind wanders to everything I could\'ve done differently'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, it makes sense that these thoughts would feel so heavy when you\'re already carrying so much. When you notice your mind going to ""what could\'ve been,"" what\'s one thing that keeps coming up for you right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I used to live by principles like fairness and accountability but lately I\'m not sure how those fit into my day anymore'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when values that once guided you—like fairness and accountability—start feeling distant, I\'m curious what those principles meant to you personally. How does their absence feel in your daily life right now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I catch myself hesitating over small things, questioning whether what I do matters at all. Even simple interactions feel heavier because the “why” behind my actions isn’t as clear.'}]","I catch myself hesitating over small things, questioning whether what I do matters at all. Even simple interactions feel heavier because the “why” behind my actions isn’t as clear.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you say nothing interests you anymore, I wonder what that emotional and physical space feels like for you—like a quiet room with no light, or something else? I\'m here to listen with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how exhausting it feels to say you\'re tired when you\'re avoiding something important. What are you finding it harder to face these days, Kenneth?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything from brushing my teeth, to walking the dog, taking out the trash, eating'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when even caring for your dog or making sure you eat feels like moving through heavy water, what does that heaviness tell you about what you\'re carrying right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My mind wanders to everything I could\'ve done differently'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, it makes sense that these thoughts would feel so heavy when you\'re already carrying so much. When you notice your mind going to ""what could\'ve been,"" what\'s one thing that keeps coming up for you right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I used to live by principles like fairness and accountability but lately I\'m not sure how those fit into my day anymore'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when values that once guided you—like fairness and accountability—start feeling distant, I\'m curious what those principles meant to you personally. How does their absence feel in your daily life right now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I catch myself hesitating over small things, questioning whether what I do matters at all. Even simple interactions feel heavier because the “why” behind my actions isn’t as clear.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you think back to times when fairness or accountability felt real to you, what\'s one small moment that stands out? I\'m curious about what that felt like for you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': They told me how to act when the stakes were high. They gave structure to choices that otherwise could feel arbitrary.}]",They told me how to act when the stakes were high. They gave structure to choices that otherwise could feel arbitrary.,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': Hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Kenneth, it\'s good to see you here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Even when something good happens, it doesn’t feel good for long. It’s like I’m watching life through glass.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That sounds really tough, Kenneth. When you describe life as if you\'re watching it through glass, what does that distance feel like for you? I\'m here to listen.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Nothing interests me anymore, not out favorite TV show, no food, I don\'t like to talk to anyone'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you say nothing interests you anymore, I wonder what that emotional and physical space feels like for you—like a quiet room with no light, or something else? I\'m here to listen with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Some days I find excuses to avoid calls or plans. I tell myself I’m tired, but it’s more than that'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I hear how exhausting it feels to say you\'re tired when you\'re avoiding something important. What are you finding it harder to face these days, Kenneth?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'Everything from brushing my teeth, to walking the dog, taking out the trash, eating'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when even caring for your dog or making sure you eat feels like moving through heavy water, what does that heaviness tell you about what you\'re carrying right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My mind wanders to everything I could\'ve done differently'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, it makes sense that these thoughts would feel so heavy when you\'re already carrying so much. When you notice your mind going to ""what could\'ve been,"" what\'s one thing that keeps coming up for you right now? I\'m here with you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I used to live by principles like fairness and accountability but lately I\'m not sure how those fit into my day anymore'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when values that once guided you—like fairness and accountability—start feeling distant, I\'m curious what those principles meant to you personally. How does their absence feel in your daily life right now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I catch myself hesitating over small things, questioning whether what I do matters at all. Even simple interactions feel heavier because the “why” behind my actions isn’t as clear.'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you think back to times when fairness or accountability felt real to you, what\'s one small moment that stands out? I\'m curious about what that felt like for you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': They told me how to act when the stakes were high. They gave structure to choices that otherwise could feel arbitrary.}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Kenneth, when you think about times when those external structures helped you feel grounded, what’s one small thing you’d do differently now if you had that clarity again? I’m curious how that shift feels in your heart right now.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I think I\'d start my mornings with more intention, like I used to before court. I would walk the dog and set the tone for the day, deciding what kind of person I want to be in the next 12 hours'}]","I think I'd start my mornings with more intention, like I used to before court. I would walk the dog and set the tone for the day, deciding what kind of person I want to be in the next 12 hours",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
