"[{'role': user, 'content': 'hi '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'hi Patricia, I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': better thanks}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s good to hear you\'re feeling a bit better. What\'s been helping you feel that way?'}, {'role': user, 'content': i wanted to chat about sleep}]",i wanted to chat about sleep,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': 'hi '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'hi Patricia, I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': better thanks}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s good to hear you\'re feeling a bit better. What\'s been helping you feel that way?'}, {'role': user, 'content': i wanted to chat about sleep}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'d love to hear more about your sleep. Could you tell me what time you usually wake up and how you feel when you wake at 3am?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'yea up at 3 most nights, and feel exhausted and mostly anxious becaue i know the day will be challenging '}]","yea up at 3 most nights, and feel exhausted and mostly anxious becaue i know the day will be challenging ",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': 'hi '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'hi Patricia, I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': better thanks}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s good to hear you\'re feeling a bit better. What\'s been helping you feel that way?'}, {'role': user, 'content': i wanted to chat about sleep}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'d love to hear more about your sleep. Could you tell me what time you usually wake up and how you feel when you wake at 3am?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'yea up at 3 most nights, and feel exhausted and mostly anxious becaue i know the day will be challenging '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I can imagine how exhausting it must be to wake up feeling anxious about the day ahead. What\'s one thing that often feels challenging about your upcoming day that makes your mind race at 3am?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'it\'s hard for sure.  just thinking about all the little things that need to get done or the things i didnt have time to do the day before '}]",it's hard for sure.  just thinking about all the little things that need to get done or the things i didnt have time to do the day before ,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': 'hi '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'hi Patricia, I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': better thanks}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s good to hear you\'re feeling a bit better. What\'s been helping you feel that way?'}, {'role': user, 'content': i wanted to chat about sleep}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'d love to hear more about your sleep. Could you tell me what time you usually wake up and how you feel when you wake at 3am?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'yea up at 3 most nights, and feel exhausted and mostly anxious becaue i know the day will be challenging '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I can imagine how exhausting it must be to wake up feeling anxious about the day ahead. What\'s one thing that often feels challenging about your upcoming day that makes your mind race at 3am?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'it\'s hard for sure.  just thinking about all the little things that need to get done or the things i didnt have time to do the day before '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'When you\'re lying there at 3am thinking about those unfinished tasks, what kind of physical sensations do you notice in your body?'}, {'role': user, 'content': tension}]",tension,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
