"[{'role': user, 'content': 'hi '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'hi Patricia, I\'m glad you\'re here. How are you feeling today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': better thanks}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That\'s good to hear you\'re feeling a bit better. What\'s been helping you feel that way?'}, {'role': user, 'content': i wanted to chat about sleep}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'d love to hear more about your sleep. Could you tell me what time you usually wake up and how you feel when you wake at 3am?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'yea up at 3 most nights, and feel exhausted and mostly anxious becaue i know the day will be challenging '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I can imagine how exhausting it must be to wake up feeling anxious about the day ahead. What\'s one thing that often feels challenging about your upcoming day that makes your mind race at 3am?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'it\'s hard for sure.  just thinking about all the little things that need to get done or the things i didnt have time to do the day before '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'When you\'re lying there at 3am thinking about those unfinished tasks, what kind of physical sensations do you notice in your body?'}, {'role': user, 'content': tension}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'It makes sense that tension would show up when your mind is caught up in unfinished tasks. Do you notice this tension building earlier in the evening, like when you\'re winding down for bed?'}, {'role': user, 'content': tension}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I wonder if you notice this tension building as you\'re wrapping up work or moving from your office to home. What happens in those moments that might make it harder to unwind?'}, {'role': user, 'content': oh yeah}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That makes sense—when you\'re leaving work behind, what thoughts or feelings come up for you during that transition?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'thoughts (i have not done enough) feelings (guilt and frustration)'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'It makes sense to feel that way when you\'re stepping away from work, especially with such high expectations. I\'m curious—when you think ""I haven\'t done enough,"" is that thought actually true, or does it feel like it might be magnifying the situation?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I\'m an overachiever, alway have been, so it\'s possible i\'m over exaggerating the situation  but to me it feel like i\'m slacking  sometimes'}]","I'm an overachiever, alway have been, so it's possible i'm over exaggerating the situation  but to me it feel like i'm slacking  sometimes",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
