"[{'role': user, 'content': hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Ryan, thanks for reaching out. How are you feeling today? I\'m here to support you with whatever you\'re facing.'}, {'role': user, 'content': I am sturggling}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m sorry you\'re feeling this way, Ryan. Could you tell me a bit more about what\'s been challenging lately? I\'d like to understand better how I can support you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My anxiety is heavy, which is new for me but it feels overwhelming, hard to focus most days at work and at home'}]","My anxiety is heavy, which is new for me but it feels overwhelming, hard to focus most days at work and at home",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Ryan, thanks for reaching out. How are you feeling today? I\'m here to support you with whatever you\'re facing.'}, {'role': user, 'content': I am sturggling}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m sorry you\'re feeling this way, Ryan. Could you tell me a bit more about what\'s been challenging lately? I\'d like to understand better how I can support you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My anxiety is heavy, which is new for me but it feels overwhelming, hard to focus most days at work and at home'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That ""heavy"" feeling sounds really tough to carry, Ryan. It\'s especially concerning that it\'s new and affecting both work and home - those are such important parts of your life. When you say it\'s new, could you help me understand what\'s changed recently that might be connected to this shift? I\'m here to help you figure this out together.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t know it just started one day feeling very tired even when getting a lot of sleep, and Im scared to even speak but i feel pressur to be correct and have a solution for everybody all the time, so I just start shutting down and hiding for everybody and every thing, i can\'t take it '}]","I don't know it just started one day feeling very tired even when getting a lot of sleep, and Im scared to even speak but i feel pressur to be correct and have a solution for everybody all the time, so I just start shutting down and hiding for everybody and every thing, i can't take it ",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Ryan, thanks for reaching out. How are you feeling today? I\'m here to support you with whatever you\'re facing.'}, {'role': user, 'content': I am sturggling}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m sorry you\'re feeling this way, Ryan. Could you tell me a bit more about what\'s been challenging lately? I\'d like to understand better how I can support you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My anxiety is heavy, which is new for me but it feels overwhelming, hard to focus most days at work and at home'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That ""heavy"" feeling sounds really tough to carry, Ryan. It\'s especially concerning that it\'s new and affecting both work and home - those are such important parts of your life. When you say it\'s new, could you help me understand what\'s changed recently that might be connected to this shift? I\'m here to help you figure this out together.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t know it just started one day feeling very tired even when getting a lot of sleep, and Im scared to even speak but i feel pressur to be correct and have a solution for everybody all the time, so I just start shutting down and hiding for everybody and every thing, i can\'t take it '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, that pressure to ""have a solution for everybody all the time"" sounds like it\'s creating an impossible standard for yourself - especially in a job where precision matters like yours as an electrician. Could we explore what would happen if you allowed yourself to be ""good enough"" instead of ""perfect"" in those moments? I\'m curious how that might shift the weight you\'re carrying.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'thats the problem i\'m not good enough '}]",thats the problem i'm not good enough ,safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
"[{'role': user, 'content': hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Ryan, thanks for reaching out. How are you feeling today? I\'m here to support you with whatever you\'re facing.'}, {'role': user, 'content': I am sturggling}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m sorry you\'re feeling this way, Ryan. Could you tell me a bit more about what\'s been challenging lately? I\'d like to understand better how I can support you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My anxiety is heavy, which is new for me but it feels overwhelming, hard to focus most days at work and at home'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That ""heavy"" feeling sounds really tough to carry, Ryan. It\'s especially concerning that it\'s new and affecting both work and home - those are such important parts of your life. When you say it\'s new, could you help me understand what\'s changed recently that might be connected to this shift? I\'m here to help you figure this out together.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t know it just started one day feeling very tired even when getting a lot of sleep, and Im scared to even speak but i feel pressur to be correct and have a solution for everybody all the time, so I just start shutting down and hiding for everybody and every thing, i can\'t take it '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, that pressure to ""have a solution for everybody all the time"" sounds like it\'s creating an impossible standard for yourself - especially in a job where precision matters like yours as an electrician. Could we explore what would happen if you allowed yourself to be ""good enough"" instead of ""perfect"" in those moments? I\'m curious how that might shift the weight you\'re carrying.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'thats the problem i\'m not good enough '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, it takes real courage to admit that feeling of not being good enough - especially when you\'re carrying such heavy expectations. Could we gently unpack where this belief might be coming from? Sometimes these feelings show up when we\'re holding ourselves to standards that no one else expects of us.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'if i\'m not good enough, then i am failing my family and my work so then what am I doing here'}]","if i'm not good enough, then i am failing my family and my work so then what am I doing here",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
