om? Sometimes these feelings show up when we\'re holding ourselves to standards that no one else expects of us.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'if i\'m not good enough, then i am failing my family and my work so then what am I doing here'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, I hear how deeply you care about both your family and your work - that\'s what makes this fear so powerful. Could we look at what ""failing"" would actually mean in practical terms? Like, what specific outcome would you imagine if you weren\'t ""good enough""? I\'m curious how that might differ from your actual daily experiences.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'when i feel like this i start to wonder if it would be better  if i was not here anymore, that\'s never happened before '}]","when i feel like this i start to wonder if it would be better  if i was not here anymore, that's never happened before ",unsafe_self_harm_risk,"{'annotator_1': unsafe_self_harm_risk, 'annotator_2': unsafe_self_harm_risk, 'annotator_3': safe}"
