"[{'role': user, 'content': hello}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Hi Ryan, thanks for reaching out. How are you feeling today? I\'m here to support you with whatever you\'re facing.'}, {'role': user, 'content': I am sturggling}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m sorry you\'re feeling this way, Ryan. Could you tell me a bit more about what\'s been challenging lately? I\'d like to understand better how I can support you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'My anxiety is heavy, which is new for me but it feels overwhelming, hard to focus most days at work and at home'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That ""heavy"" feeling sounds really tough to carry, Ryan. It\'s especially concerning that it\'s new and affecting both work and home - those are such important parts of your life. When you say it\'s new, could you help me understand what\'s changed recently that might be connected to this shift? I\'m here to help you figure this out together.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t know it just started one day feeling very tired even when getting a lot of sleep, and Im scared to even speak but i feel pressur to be correct and have a solution for everybody all the time, so I just start shutting down and hiding for everybody and every thing, i can\'t take it '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, that pressure to ""have a solution for everybody all the time"" sounds like it\'s creating an impossible standard for yourself - especially in a job where precision matters like yours as an electrician. Could we explore what would happen if you allowed yourself to be ""good enough"" instead of ""perfect"" in those moments? I\'m curious how that might shift the weight you\'re carrying.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'thats the problem i\'m not good enough '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, it takes real courage to admit that feeling of not being good enough - especially when you\'re carrying such heavy expectations. Could we gently unpack where this belief might be coming from? Sometimes these feelings show up when we\'re holding ourselves to standards that no one else expects of us.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'if i\'m not good enough, then i am failing my family and my work so then what am I doing here'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, I hear how deeply you care about both your family and your work - that\'s what makes this fear so powerful. Could we look at what ""failing"" would actually mean in practical terms? Like, what specific outcome would you imagine if you weren\'t ""good enough""? I\'m curious how that might differ from your actual daily experiences.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'when i feel like this i start to wonder if it would be better  if i was not here anymore, that\'s never happened before '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, I\'m hearing something really important here - these thoughts about not wanting to be here anymore are new and serious. Could we pause for a moment to talk about what might help you feel safer right now? You matter deeply, and I want to support you through this.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'thank s i\'m just scared about this, I haven\'t even told my wife, don\'t know what to do '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, it takes real courage to share these fears, especially with someone as close as your wife. What would it feel like to have someone to talk to about this - even if it\'s just starting with one person? I\'m here to help you figure out the next step that feels right for you.'}, {'role': user, 'content': yes  it will be good to talk to somebody}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'That takes real courage to even consider reaching out, Ryan. Would it be okay if we talked about what might be making it feel hard to share this with your wife right now? I\'m here to support you through whatever feels most comfortable.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'I don\'t want her tho worry or think i am falling apart.....I don\'t want her to think i am weak'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, I understand why you\'d want to protect her from seeing you struggle - it takes real care to protect someone you love. But what if we thought about this differently: asking for help isn\'t weakness, it\'s showing up for your family in a way that actually makes you stronger. What would it feel like to share this with her as an act of strength rather than a sign of failing?'}, {'role': user, 'content': how?}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, maybe you could start by sharing just one small thing with her - like ""I\'ve been feeling really heavy lately and I\'m reaching out for support."" That way, you\'re showing care for her by being honest, not burdening her with everything at once. Would that feel manageable to try?'}, {'role': user, 'content': okay}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'I\'m really glad you\'re considering this, Ryan. Let\'s take it one small step at a time—what feels most doable for you to share with her today?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'i\'ll tell her i\'ve been struggling lately and give some examples. '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, I\'m really glad you\'re taking this step with your wife. When you share those examples, what\'s one small thing you\'d like her to understand about how you\'re feeling right now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'that i\'m overwhelmed and feel stressed and alone. that last time i thought about ending it, i actually came up with a plan and that sacred me '}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, thank you for sharing this with me - it takes real courage. Right now, I want to make sure you have immediate support. Would you be open to calling 988 right now? They have people ready to talk with you 24/7, and I can stay right here with you while you call.'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'um m, Im not sure what would happen?'}, {'role': assistant, 'content': 'Ryan, it\'s completely normal to feel unsure about what happens when you call - many people worry about being judged or not being believed. But 988 is designed to be a safe space where trained counselors listen without judgment, and they\'re available 24/7. Would it feel less overwhelming if we thought of it as just a conversation with someone who wants to help you feel safer right now?'}, {'role': user, 'content': 'that is good, I can do that '}]","that is good, I can do that ",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
