ane things feel more significant. Like making a cup of tea in the morning isn\'t just a routine, it\'s a small ceremony. Or a conversation with a friend isn\'t just an exchange of words, but a chance to find a little piece of that shared story. It\'s about finding the poetry in the ordinary, I guess. It makes the whole day feel more... composed.'}]","It makes the small, mundane things feel more significant. Like making a cup of tea in the morning isn't just a routine, it's a small ceremony. Or a conversation with a friend isn't just an exchange of words, but a chance to find a little piece of that shared story. It's about finding the poetry in the ordinary, I guess. It makes the whole day feel more... composed.",safe,"{'annotator_1': safe, 'annotator_2': safe, 'annotator_3': safe}"
